## Repo Structure

```
/home/ubuntu/avatar-setup/
├── Realtime-Avatar/              # Production repo (ALL future work goes here)
│   ├── main_server.py            # Production WebRTC server (4.8k lines)
│   ├── musetalk/                 # Model code (mostly vendored upstream)
│   │   ├── models/
│   │   │   ├── vae.py            # VAE class + decode_latents_tensor + TAESD support
│   │   │   └── unet.py           # UNet class (3.2GB .pth via torch.load)
│   │   └── utils/
│   │       ├── preprocessing.py  # Eager DWPose/S3FD import at module level (needs lazy loading)
│   │       ├── blending.py       # get_image_prepare_material
│   │       └── face_parsing/     # BiSeNet face parsing
│   ├── documentation/
│   │   ├── optimization-benchmarks/  # Results from MuseTalk fork benchmarks
│   │   └── architecture/         # rendering.md, voice-and-protocol.md, operations.md, etc.
│   ├── STARTUP-PERF.md           # Comprehensive warm/cold start analysis and plan
│   ├── AGENTS.md                 # Repo orientation for AI agents
│   ├── benchmark.py              # Production benchmark harness
│   └── tests/                    # test_relay_protocol.py, test_mic_gate.py, test_blank_avatar.py
├── MuseTalk/                     # Benchmark fork (reference only now)
│   ├── .venv/                    # Python 3.12 virtualenv
│   ├── scripts/benchmark.py      # Fork's benchmark harness
│   ├── results/TASK-*.md         # Benchmark results (copied to Realtime-Avatar/documentation/)
│   └── docs/analysis/            # Analysis docs (also copied)
```

## Docker Container (running production)

```bash
# The production server runs in Docker
docker exec musetalk <command>    # Run commands inside the container
docker logs musetalk              # View server logs

# Model weights inside container
# /app/models/musetalkV15/unet.pth (3.2GB, .pth format — bottleneck)
# /app/models/sd-vae/ (320MB, already .safetensors)
# /app/models/whisper/ (145MB, pytorch_model.bin)
# /app/models/dwpose/dw-ll_ucoco_384.pth (389MB)

# Avatar runtime cache inside container
# /app/results/v15/avatars/avator_1/runtime/rgb_frames.npy (2.8GB, mmap)
# /app/results/v15/avatars/avator_1/runtime/idle_frames.npy (2.8GB, mmap)
# /app/results/v15/avatars/avator_1/runtime/alpha.npy (94MB)
# /app/results/v15/avatars/avator_1/latents.pt (15MB)
```

## Key Production Classes (main_server.py)

- `MuseTalkAvatar`: avatar cache, runtime geometry, idle frames, blend params
- `MuseTalkEngine`: model loading, initialize(), build_idle_cycle(), warmup(), render_batch()
- `AzureRealtimeSession`: WebRTC + GPT Realtime voice loop
- `ServerConfig`: all config flags (compile_models, vae_decoder, etc.)

## Key API Facts

- UNet input: latent [batch, 8, 32, 32] (masked + ref concatenated), conditioning [batch, 50, 384]
- Single-step inpainting (timestep=0), NOT iterative diffusion
- Production blend: `(alpha * face_inter) + base_part` — simple numpy, NOT BiSeNet+morphology
- Production decode: `decode_latents_tensor()` keeps data on GPU as uint8 tensor
- Runtime cache uses np.load(mmap_mode="r") for 2.8GB rgb_frames.npy
